--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
NOTES specific to this dataset (do not override the license, but read before use):

1. Source attribution. Phishing URLs derive from the NCSC "Tin Nhiem Mang"
   blacklist and benign URLs from its trusted-organisation registry and the
   Tranco top-list; please also credit those upstream sources where required.

2. Malicious content. Captured phishing HTML pages and screenshots depict live
   malicious / brand-cloning pages. They are provided for research only, in a
   GATED tier (on request), and must NOT be redistributed as attack material or
   used to deceive. Do not open captured HTML outside an isolated environment.

3. Privacy. Personal data has been redacted to tokens; any id↔PII mapping is
   kept private and encrypted, and is NOT part of this release. Use complies
   with Decree 13/2023/ND-CP and Vietnam's Personal Data Protection Law.

The accompanying source CODE (scripts/) is licensed separately under the MIT
License; see LICENSE-CODE.
